    [5463] = {"Menethil's Gift",60,57,nil,"Travel to Stratholme and find Menethil's Gift. Place the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the unholy ground.",{11036},{},{},{},{176631},{5462},{},{},{},nil,nil,nil,{}},
